        "content": "## Setup (v10 webhook + website fetch)\n1. Import as NEW workflow (do not overwrite the live one). Replace REPLACE_WITH_WORKSPACE_SECRET in **IF - Secret OK** with the same workspace secret used by the transcription webhook.\n2. Credentials: pick the Gmail credential on **Gmail - Send Audit PDF**. Apify, OpenAI and htmlcsstopdf carry over from the live workflow — re-select on the canvas if any shows as missing.\n3. Activate the workflow. Use the PRODUCTION webhook URL only, and give it only to the workspace developer.\n4. Report = **Validate Sources** → Generate Parts A/B/C (temperature 0.2) → **Assemble Report** → **Clean HTML** (throws if <12 sections) → **Convert HTML to PDF** → **Gmail - Send Audit PDF**.",
